{"id":"forecast-09","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-09/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":276.79,"segments":[{"start":0.02,"end":4.36,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",0.02,0.6],["listen",0.6,0.96],["carefully",0.96,1.48],["and",1.48,1.92],["answer",1.92,2.42],["questions",2.42,2.88],["31",2.88,3.62],["to",3.62,3.96],["40.",3.96,4.36]]},{"start":5.0,"end":16.5,"text":"I'm a past student of this university, and I'm joining some others on this career day to tell you about my job, as it may be something you've never thought of doing.","words":[["I'm",5.0,5.68],["a",5.68,5.86],["past",5.86,6.1],["student",6.1,6.62],["of",6.62,6.86],["this",6.86,7.1],["university,",7.1,7.68],["and",8.16,8.74],["I'm",8.74,9.14],["joining",9.14,9.62],["some",9.62,9.98],["others",9.98,10.42],["on",10.42,10.74],["this",10.74,10.96],["career",10.96,11.32],["day",11.32,11.74],["to",11.74,11.94],["tell",11.94,12.2],["you",12.2,12.5],["about",12.5,12.8],["my",12.8,13.14],["job,",13.14,13.6],["as",13.88,14.22],["it",14.22,14.38],["may",14.38,14.54],["be",14.54,14.74],["something",14.74,15.06],["you've",15.06,15.42],["never",15.42,15.62],["thought",15.62,15.94],["of",15.94,16.16],["doing.",16.16,16.5]]},{"start":17.32,"end":24.68,"text":"I'm a patent attorney. Some of you probably know what that is, but for those of you that don't, I'll explain.","words":[["I'm",17.32,17.78],["a",17.78,17.9],["patent",17.9,18.18],["attorney.",18.18,18.64],["Some",19.4,19.78],["of",19.78,19.94],["you",19.94,20.06],["probably",20.06,20.44],["know",20.44,20.86],["what",20.86,21.1],["that",21.1,21.36],["is,",21.36,21.72],["but",21.98,22.34],["for",22.34,22.54],["those",22.54,22.76],["of",22.76,23.0],["you",23.0,23.14],["that",23.14,23.34],["don't,",23.34,23.76],["I'll",23.96,24.18],["explain.",24.18,24.68]]},{"start":24.68,"end":29.78,"text":"If someone has a new idea or invention, they can ask for a patent.","words":[["If",24.68,25.78],["someone",25.78,26.14],["has",26.14,26.48],["a",26.48,26.68],["new",26.68,26.82],["idea",26.82,27.3],["or",27.3,27.62],["invention,",27.62,28.08],["they",28.4,28.52],["can",28.52,28.72],["ask",28.72,29.04],["for",29.04,29.3],["a",29.3,29.48],["patent.",29.48,29.78]]},{"start":30.62,"end":34.8,"text":"It gives the owner the right to stop other people from using that invention.","words":[["It",30.62,30.9],["gives",30.9,31.16],["the",31.16,31.36],["owner",31.36,31.7],["the",31.7,31.92],["right",31.92,32.16],["to",32.16,32.36],["stop",32.36,32.68],["other",32.68,32.96],["people",32.96,33.3],["from",33.3,33.56],["using",33.56,33.88],["that",33.88,34.24],["invention.",34.24,34.8]]},{"start":35.76,"end":42.14,"text":"A patent is granted by the government to inventors, or more usually these days to a company.","words":[["A",35.76,36.02],["patent",36.02,36.32],["is",36.32,36.62],["granted",36.62,36.98],["by",36.98,37.3],["the",37.3,37.46],["government",37.46,37.9],["to",37.9,38.3],["inventors,",38.3,39.2],["or",39.54,39.98],["more",39.98,40.24],["usually",40.24,40.7],["these",40.7,41.04],["days",41.04,41.38],["to",41.38,41.62],["a",41.62,41.82],["company.",41.82,42.14]]},{"start":42.76,"end":47.54,"text":"It is for a certain time period, usually a maximum of 20 years.","words":[["It",42.76,42.94],["is",42.94,43.08],["for",43.08,43.28],["a",43.28,43.44],["certain",43.44,43.74],["time",43.74,44.16],["period,",44.16,44.66],["usually",45.04,45.5],["a",45.5,45.86],["maximum",45.86,46.28],["of",46.28,46.74],["20",46.74,47.08],["years.",47.08,47.54]]},{"start":48.46,"end":54.0,"text":"So during that period, that idea or invention cannot be claimed to have been invented","words":[["So",48.46,48.82],["during",48.82,49.16],["that",49.16,49.42],["period,",49.42,49.96],["that",50.3,50.5],["idea",50.5,51.04],["or",51.04,51.32],["invention",51.32,51.84],["cannot",51.84,52.22],["be",52.22,52.52],["claimed",52.52,52.9],["to",52.9,53.08],["have",53.08,53.28],["been",53.28,53.48],["invented",53.48,54.0]]},{"start":54.0,"end":55.14,"text":"by someone else.","words":[["by",54.0,54.32],["someone",54.32,54.72],["else.",54.72,55.14]]},{"start":56.08,"end":58.84,"text":"The likelihood of getting a patent is dependent","words":[["The",56.08,56.34],["likelihood",56.34,56.7],["of",56.7,57.26],["getting",57.26,57.6],["a",57.6,57.8],["patent",57.8,58.08],["is",58.08,58.4],["dependent",58.4,58.84]]},{"start":58.84,"end":61.9,"text":"on whether the invention is original or not.","words":[["on",58.84,59.28],["whether",59.28,59.56],["the",59.56,59.8],["invention",59.8,60.24],["is",60.24,60.7],["original",60.7,61.22],["or",61.22,61.58],["not.",61.58,61.9]]},{"start":62.5,"end":64.18,"text":"This is the crucial factor.","words":[["This",62.5,62.86],["is",62.86,63.18],["the",63.18,63.32],["crucial",63.32,63.68],["factor.",63.68,64.18]]},{"start":65.02,"end":67.84,"text":"It will be looked at by a patent examiner,","words":[["It",65.02,65.26],["will",65.26,65.42],["be",65.42,65.58],["looked",65.58,65.82],["at",65.82,66.1],["by",66.1,66.4],["a",66.4,66.6],["patent",66.6,66.96],["examiner,",66.96,67.84]]},{"start":68.04,"end":70.88,"text":"and my job is to convince the examiner","words":[["and",68.04,68.38],["my",68.38,68.6],["job",68.6,68.98],["is",68.98,69.24],["to",69.24,69.38],["convince",69.38,69.74],["the",69.74,70.1],["examiner",70.1,70.88]]},{"start":70.88,"end":73.66,"text":"that the invention is not just an adjustment","words":[["that",70.88,71.36],["the",71.36,71.52],["invention",71.52,71.98],["is",71.98,72.34],["not",72.34,72.6],["just",72.6,72.92],["an",72.92,73.26],["adjustment",73.26,73.66]]},{"start":73.66,"end":75.72,"text":"to something which already exists.","words":[["to",73.66,74.06],["something",74.06,74.4],["which",74.4,74.72],["already",74.72,75.18],["exists.",75.18,75.72]]},{"start":76.66,"end":78.16,"text":"In order to get the patent,","words":[["In",76.66,77.0],["order",77.0,77.24],["to",77.24,77.44],["get",77.44,77.62],["the",77.62,77.76],["patent,",77.76,78.16]]},{"start":78.32,"end":81.32,"text":"we need to produce a full description of the invention.","words":[["we",78.32,78.42],["need",78.42,78.62],["to",78.62,78.8],["produce",78.8,79.18],["a",79.18,79.46],["full",79.46,79.68],["description",79.68,80.16],["of",80.16,80.64],["the",80.64,80.82],["invention.",80.82,81.32]]},{"start":81.96,"end":84.92,"text":"It's really important to get the details right.","words":[["It's",81.96,82.6],["really",82.6,82.86],["important",82.86,83.4],["to",83.4,83.7],["get",83.7,83.8],["the",83.8,83.96],["details",83.96,84.36],["right.",84.36,84.92]]},{"start":85.94,"end":91.76,"text":"Most of you are scientists and the basic requirement of the job is a solid academic background.","words":[["Most",85.94,86.22],["of",86.22,86.46],["you",86.46,86.66],["are",86.66,86.78],["scientists",86.78,87.3],["and",87.3,87.78],["the",87.78,87.94],["basic",87.94,88.28],["requirement",88.28,88.84],["of",88.84,89.26],["the",89.26,89.38],["job",89.38,89.7],["is",89.7,90.0],["a",90.0,90.16],["solid",90.16,90.54],["academic",90.54,91.16],["background.",91.16,91.76]]},{"start":92.92,"end":97.0,"text":"Often, people have studied chemistry or alternatively engineering.","words":[["Often,",92.92,93.46],["people",93.58,93.82],["have",93.82,94.04],["studied",94.04,94.36],["chemistry",94.36,94.92],["or",94.92,95.38],["alternatively",95.38,96.44],["engineering.",96.44,97.0]]},{"start":98.36,"end":102.22,"text":"Because of the nature of the work, this is a crucial starting point.","words":[["Because",98.36,98.86],["of",98.86,99.16],["the",99.16,99.28],["nature",99.28,99.58],["of",99.58,99.84],["the",99.84,99.98],["work,",99.98,100.26],["this",100.42,100.6],["is",100.6,100.8],["a",100.8,100.94],["crucial",100.94,101.3],["starting",101.3,101.74],["point.",101.74,102.22]]},{"start":103.02,"end":106.92,"text":"You need to be able to understand how the inventions have come about.","words":[["You",103.02,103.34],["need",103.34,103.54],["to",103.54,103.72],["be",103.72,103.86],["able",103.86,104.08],["to",104.08,104.24],["understand",104.24,104.74],["how",104.74,105.24],["the",105.24,105.42],["inventions",105.42,105.9],["have",105.9,106.26],["come",106.26,106.5],["about.",106.5,106.92]]},{"start":106.92,"end":111.7,"text":"On top of that, employers are looking for particular kinds of people.","words":[["On",106.92,108.0],["top",108.0,108.3],["of",108.3,108.5],["that,",108.5,108.72],["employers",108.96,109.3],["are",109.3,109.6],["looking",109.6,109.86],["for",109.86,110.16],["particular",110.16,110.66],["kinds",110.66,111.14],["of",111.14,111.36],["people.",111.36,111.7]]},{"start":112.84,"end":116.26,"text":"They want employees who have excellent communication skills.","words":[["They",112.84,113.02],["want",113.02,113.32],["employees",113.32,113.92],["who",113.92,114.22],["have",114.22,114.36],["excellent",114.36,114.88],["communication",114.88,115.52],["skills.",115.52,116.26]]},{"start":117.14,"end":122.84,"text":"So you can talk to inventors in terms that they can understand and also ask the right questions.","words":[["So",117.14,117.52],["you",117.52,117.66],["can",117.66,117.84],["talk",117.84,118.1],["to",118.1,118.3],["inventors",118.3,118.84],["in",118.84,119.14],["terms",119.14,119.44],["that",119.44,119.68],["they",119.68,119.84],["can",119.84,120.0],["understand",120.0,120.58],["and",120.58,121.02],["also",121.02,121.48],["ask",121.48,121.86],["the",121.86,122.06],["right",122.06,122.26],["questions.",122.26,122.84]]},{"start":123.98,"end":127.22,"text":"These aren't necessarily skills you're taught at university.","words":[["These",123.98,124.3],["aren't",124.3,124.72],["necessarily",124.72,125.26],["skills",125.26,125.72],["you're",125.72,126.18],["taught",126.18,126.4],["at",126.4,126.7],["university.",126.7,127.22]]},{"start":128.48,"end":131.76,"text":"This is an international business, as are most nowadays,","words":[["This",128.48,128.84],["is",128.84,129.04],["an",129.04,129.18],["international",129.18,129.7],["business,",129.7,130.4],["as",130.56,130.78],["are",130.78,131.0],["most",131.0,131.34],["nowadays,",131.34,131.76]]},{"start":131.76,"end":137.14,"text":"days and it's very convenient to be able to read documents without having to call for","words":[["days",131.76,132.12],["and",132.12,132.9],["it's",132.9,133.1],["very",133.1,133.38],["convenient",133.38,133.96],["to",133.96,134.18],["be",134.18,134.36],["able",134.36,134.56],["to",134.56,134.74],["read",134.74,135.0],["documents",135.0,135.56],["without",135.56,135.96],["having",135.96,136.44],["to",136.44,136.6],["call",136.6,136.9],["for",136.9,137.14]]},{"start":137.14,"end":137.82,"text":"translations.","words":[["translations.",137.14,137.82]]},{"start":138.92,"end":143.42,"text":"So if you can understand a foreign language, that's a great asset.","words":[["So",138.92,139.4],["if",139.4,139.88],["you",139.88,140.06],["can",140.06,140.28],["understand",140.28,140.76],["a",140.76,141.02],["foreign",141.02,141.22],["language,",141.22,141.7],["that's",142.0,142.4],["a",142.4,142.52],["great",142.52,142.84],["asset.",142.84,143.42]]},{"start":144.42,"end":148.92,"text":"You might think it sounds a bit boring from what I've said, but it really isn't.","words":[["You",144.42,144.84],["might",144.84,145.08],["think",145.08,145.3],["it",145.3,145.48],["sounds",145.48,145.72],["a",145.72,145.92],["bit",145.92,146.04],["boring",146.04,146.42],["from",146.42,146.66],["what",146.66,146.86],["I've",146.86,147.1],["said,",147.1,147.44],["but",147.62,147.9],["it",147.9,148.06],["really",148.06,148.36],["isn't.",148.36,148.92]]},{"start":149.6,"end":152.34,"text":"There are lots of advantages to the job.","words":[["There",149.6,149.98],["are",149.98,150.2],["lots",150.2,150.54],["of",150.54,150.76],["advantages",150.76,151.4],["to",151.4,151.76],["the",151.76,151.92],["job.",151.92,152.34]]},{"start":153.04,"end":155.32,"text":"It's extremely interesting for a start.","words":[["It's",153.04,153.42],["extremely",153.42,153.88],["interesting",153.88,154.5],["for",154.5,154.84],["a",154.84,155.02],["start.",155.02,155.32]]},{"start":155.98,"end":160.02,"text":"For example, I feel I use a range of expertise.","words":[["For",155.98,156.3],["example,",156.3,156.78],["I",157.3,157.58],["feel",157.58,157.86],["I",157.86,158.16],["use",158.16,158.54],["a",158.54,158.78],["range",158.78,159.18],["of",159.18,159.4],["expertise.",159.4,160.02]]},{"start":160.64,"end":165.72,"text":"I'm not just a scientist, not just a lawyer, but a mixture of the two.","words":[["I'm",160.64,161.2],["not",161.2,161.38],["just",161.38,161.64],["a",161.64,161.84],["scientist,",161.84,162.3],["not",162.76,163.0],["just",163.0,163.26],["a",163.26,163.46],["lawyer,",163.46,163.78],["but",164.2,164.5],["a",164.5,164.66],["mixture",164.66,164.88],["of",164.88,165.24],["the",165.24,165.38],["two.",165.38,165.72]]},{"start":166.66,"end":172.28,"text":"Although it takes quite a long time to qualify as a patent attorney, anything from four to","words":[["Although",166.66,167.04],["it",167.04,167.28],["takes",167.28,167.54],["quite",167.54,167.84],["a",167.84,168.04],["long",168.04,168.22],["time",168.22,168.48],["to",168.48,168.68],["qualify",168.68,169.14],["as",169.14,169.52],["a",169.52,169.68],["patent",169.68,169.92],["attorney,",169.92,170.4],["anything",171.04,171.38],["from",171.38,171.82],["four",171.82,172.1],["to",172.1,172.28]]},{"start":172.28,"end":178.16,"text":"six years, after that, you can earn a high salary which compares very well with other","words":[["six",172.28,172.52],["years,",172.52,172.96],["after",173.4,173.72],["that,",173.72,174.08],["you",174.54,174.78],["can",174.78,174.96],["earn",174.96,175.16],["a",175.16,175.28],["high",175.28,175.5],["salary",175.5,176.0],["which",176.0,176.34],["compares",176.34,176.78],["very",176.78,177.2],["well",177.2,177.58],["with",177.58,177.84],["other",177.84,178.16]]},{"start":178.16,"end":179.26,"text":"similar professions.","words":[["similar",178.16,178.6],["professions.",178.6,179.26]]},{"start":180.26,"end":182.48,"text":"There are some disadvantages, of course.","words":[["There",180.26,180.54],["are",180.54,180.76],["some",180.76,180.98],["disadvantages,",180.98,181.72],["of",182.06,182.14],["course.",182.14,182.48]]},{"start":183.34,"end":188.02,"text":"It can be rather lonely as you tend to sit in front of a computer for most of the","words":[["It",183.34,183.56],["can",183.56,183.74],["be",183.74,183.96],["rather",183.96,184.22],["lonely",184.22,184.74],["as",184.74,185.14],["you",185.14,185.3],["tend",185.3,185.54],["to",185.54,185.74],["sit",185.74,185.98],["in",185.98,186.22],["front",186.22,186.38],["of",186.38,186.52],["a",186.52,186.64],["computer",186.64,187.04],["for",187.04,187.32],["most",187.32,187.68],["of",187.68,187.88],["the",187.88,188.02]]},{"start":188.02,"end":188.34,"text":"day.","words":[["day.",188.02,188.34]]},{"start":188.98,"end":193.0,"text":"Even if you have colleagues, you will all be working separately.","words":[["Even",188.98,189.62],["if",189.62,189.88],["you",189.88,190.02],["have",190.02,190.24],["colleagues,",190.24,190.8],["you",191.3,191.4],["will",191.4,191.58],["all",191.58,191.82],["be",191.82,192.02],["working",192.02,192.42],["separately.",192.42,193.0]]},{"start":193.96,"end":197.14,"text":"And there isn't very much flexibility with location.","words":[["And",193.96,194.24],["there",194.24,194.46],["isn't",194.46,194.86],["very",194.86,195.16],["much",195.16,195.46],["flexibility",195.46,196.08],["with",196.08,196.58],["location.",196.58,197.14]]},{"start":198.1,"end":201.5,"text":"Almost all vacancies for trainees are city-based.","words":[["Almost",198.1,198.64],["all",198.64,199.02],["vacancies",199.02,199.56],["for",199.56,199.82],["trainees",199.82,200.34],["are",200.34,200.8],["city",200.8,201.16],["-based.",201.16,201.5]]},{"start":202.46,"end":206.02,"text":"So if that doesn't appeal to you, you might want to think again.","words":[["So",202.46,202.82],["if",202.82,203.0],["that",203.0,203.24],["doesn't",203.24,203.56],["appeal",203.56,203.92],["to",203.92,204.14],["you,",204.14,204.4],["you",204.52,204.66],["might",204.66,204.9],["want",204.9,205.14],["to",205.14,205.34],["think",205.34,205.54],["again.",205.54,206.02]]},{"start":206.86,"end":210.0,"text":"You do get to travel a bit to meetings with clients.","words":[["You",206.86,207.22],["do",207.22,207.4],["get",207.4,207.64],["to",207.64,207.82],["travel",207.82,208.14],["a",208.14,208.4],["bit",208.4,208.6],["to",208.6,208.92],["meetings",208.92,209.2],["with",209.2,209.5],["clients.",209.5,210.0]]},{"start":210.84,"end":212.96,"text":"And there are also visits to court.","words":[["And",210.84,211.08],["there",211.08,211.28],["are",211.28,211.52],["also",211.52,211.94],["visits",211.94,212.3],["to",212.3,212.62],["court.",212.62,212.96]]},{"start":212.96,"end":217.36,"text":"So, what kind of organization might you end up working in?","words":[["So,",212.96,214.22],["what",214.28,214.52],["kind",214.52,214.82],["of",214.82,214.98],["organization",214.98,215.58],["might",215.58,215.96],["you",215.96,216.18],["end",216.18,216.44],["up",216.44,216.66],["working",216.66,217.0],["in?",217.0,217.36]]},{"start":218.22,"end":221.62,"text":"Well, many people work in industrial companies.","words":[["Well,",218.22,218.68],["many",218.7,218.96],["people",218.96,219.34],["work",219.34,219.74],["in",219.74,220.24],["industrial",220.24,220.88],["companies.",220.88,221.62]]},{"start":222.46,"end":225.1,"text":"The big ones have their own patent departments.","words":[["The",222.46,222.72],["big",222.72,222.94],["ones",222.94,223.14],["have",223.14,223.4],["their",223.4,223.62],["own",223.62,223.94],["patent",223.94,224.4],["departments.",224.4,225.1]]},{"start":226.14,"end":230.98,"text":"The kind of product you might work with there will range from food to heavy equipment.","words":[["The",226.14,226.32],["kind",226.32,226.58],["of",226.58,226.78],["product",226.78,227.12],["you",227.12,227.4],["might",227.4,227.58],["work",227.58,227.9],["with",227.9,228.24],["there",228.24,228.6],["will",228.6,228.86],["range",228.86,229.24],["from",229.24,229.54],["food",229.54,229.92],["to",229.92,230.14],["heavy",230.14,230.46],["equipment.",230.46,230.98]]},{"start":232.12,"end":235.0,"text":"From biotechnology to the car industry.","words":[["From",232.12,232.44],["biotechnology",232.44,233.14],["to",233.14,233.92],["the",233.92,234.1],["car",234.1,234.4],["industry.",234.4,235.0]]},{"start":235.82,"end":239.72,"text":"Basically, any organization where significant time and money","words":[["Basically,",235.82,236.48],["any",237.0,237.22],["organization",237.22,237.98],["where",237.98,238.26],["significant",238.26,238.78],["time",238.78,239.26],["and",239.26,239.44],["money",239.44,239.72]]},{"start":239.72,"end":243.98,"text":"is put into research and development to get ahead of the market.","words":[["is",239.72,240.02],["put",240.02,240.24],["into",240.24,240.56],["research",240.56,241.06],["and",241.06,241.46],["development",241.46,242.02],["to",242.02,242.76],["get",242.76,242.94],["ahead",242.94,243.3],["of",243.3,243.5],["the",243.5,243.62],["market.",243.62,243.98]]},{"start":244.7,"end":247.24,"text":"There are also many private practices.","words":[["There",244.7,245.06],["are",245.06,245.28],["also",245.28,245.76],["many",245.76,246.1],["private",246.1,246.64],["practices.",246.64,247.24]]},{"start":248.64,"end":251.92,"text":"And some of these will have areas of special interest.","words":[["And",248.64,248.96],["some",248.96,249.22],["of",249.22,249.42],["these",249.42,249.6],["will",249.6,249.82],["have",249.82,250.08],["areas",250.08,250.56],["of",250.56,250.84],["special",250.84,251.28],["interest.",251.28,251.92]]},{"start":252.76,"end":257.1,"text":"Finally, it's possible to get a job in various government offices.","words":[["Finally,",252.76,253.44],["it's",253.88,254.04],["possible",254.04,254.5],["to",254.5,254.76],["get",254.76,254.94],["a",254.94,255.08],["job",255.08,255.4],["in",255.4,255.62],["various",255.62,256.02],["government",256.02,256.46],["offices.",256.46,257.1]]},{"start":258.08,"end":263.98,"text":"In those departments, you'll probably be looking at applications for patents and making decisions","words":[["In",258.08,258.42],["those",258.42,258.68],["departments,",258.68,259.28],["you'll",259.84,260.16],["probably",260.16,260.58],["be",260.58,260.94],["looking",260.94,261.24],["at",261.24,261.52],["applications",261.52,262.02],["for",262.02,262.44],["patents",262.44,262.86],["and",262.86,263.14],["making",263.14,263.42],["decisions",263.42,263.98]]},{"start":263.98,"end":264.8,"text":"about them.","words":[["about",263.98,264.42],["them.",264.42,264.8]]},{"start":264.8,"end":271.58,"text":"I really love my job, so I hope I persuaded a few of you that it's worth thinking about.","words":[["I",264.8,265.9],["really",265.9,266.38],["love",266.38,266.72],["my",266.72,267.02],["job,",267.02,267.5],["so",267.86,268.1],["I",268.1,268.38],["hope",268.38,268.64],["I",268.64,268.86],["persuaded",268.86,269.22],["a",269.22,269.68],["few",269.68,269.82],["of",269.82,270.0],["you",270.0,270.18],["that",270.18,270.38],["it's",270.38,270.6],["worth",270.6,270.8],["thinking",270.8,271.2],["about.",271.2,271.58]]},{"start":272.26,"end":276.4,"text":"If anyone wants to come and ask questions, I'm happy to answer them.","words":[["If",272.26,272.46],["anyone",272.46,272.78],["wants",272.78,273.14],["to",273.14,273.32],["come",273.32,273.56],["and",273.56,273.7],["ask",273.7,273.96],["questions,",273.96,274.52],["I'm",274.96,275.2],["happy",275.2,275.5],["to",275.5,275.72],["answer",275.72,276.08],["them.",276.08,276.4]]}]}